From 8b80d7ee4f430639ac9c7d74fac358f75dd8a568 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 17:36:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add layered investment-ecosystem dashboard (React + Vite +
 Leaflet)

Multi-view dashboard over a relational Organizations/Capital Flows/Capital
Instruments model: overview stats, segment-grouped organizations with a
relational drill-down drawer, capital flows, instruments, and a Leaflet/OSM
map that plots organizations with coordinates and skips those without.

Reads a baked JSON snapshot (public/data/ecosystem.json) so it deploys as a
static site with no browser-side tokens. Includes scripts/export-airtable.mjs
to regenerate the snapshot from Airtable once base access is available.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01RckUKg17n8C7BEJDRvPmyq
